    "conversation_text": "Hi! Welcome to Vitality Health Club. We offer everything you need in a gym—free parking, over 35 group classes weekly, and 200 square meters dedicated for beginners. What brings you here today?\nThanks for the overview. Yeah, exactly. I’m really concerned about being locked in for a year and how the price might increase when it comes time to renew.\nI understand your concern. Our contract is rolling month-to-month, and we don't have any cancellation penalties. The membership price remains fixed for a year from the start date, and after that, it's set to reprice based on market conditions.\nThat’s reassuring. So, the pricing stays consistent for a year and then adjusts annually. But I must admit, the 30% difference at the nearby gym is quite compelling.\nYes, we appreciate that. The 12-month plan does come with a 15% discount. It's a great option if you want to lock in the current price for a whole year. Would you like to take a look at our pricing page together?\nThank you for that information. Just to clarify, can you provide me with some specific details on how the price renews after a year? Is there any guarantee that it won’t go up, especially considering the competitive rates elsewhere?\nCertainly, under our plan, the price remains fixed for a full year from the date of your join. After that, it will adjust based on market changes. There's no guaranteed rate increase, but we try to keep costs stable. If you're ready to move forward, we can definitely walk you through more specifics.\nThanks for your time and for addressing my concerns, but I think I need some more time to compare all the options. Maybe we can chat again soon."
}